                                at 2026-08-18T03:08:46.581561965Z
                                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                                kind @decision
                                text "Add -e as an independent cd option bit and preserve -L/-P last-one-wins semantics. docd now distinguishes a failed chdir from a successful change whose physical PWD cannot be recovered; only the latter combined with effective -P and -e returns status 1, without misreporting the directory change as a chdir failure. A deleted-cwd unit test pins the real getcwd-failure path. Focused POSIX case passes; cargo test -p nsh is 262/0."
                            }
                        )
                    }

                    {
