                                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                                kind @note
                                text "Before removing a preceding component for dot-dot, logical canonicalization now checks that the accumulated component resolves (following symlinks) to a directory. On failure it leaves the original operand for the real chdir, which produces the appropriate diagnostic instead of silently changing to the collapsed parent. Focused POSIX cases are 2/2 and cargo test -p nsh is 262/0."
                            }
                        )
                    }

                    {
