                                at 2026-08-18T04:39:49.300651612Z
                                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                                kind @decision
                                text "Separate reportable inherited trap commands from the live trap table. forkreset snapshots the effective listing before clearing live non-ignored actions; nested subshells inherit that snapshot; a bare trap lists it; and the first operand-bearing trap discards it so later listings show current child state. Remove the obsolete cbytes adapter because it appended a terminator that single_quote treated as output data. Strengthen the case to cover direct and nested inherited listings, snapshot invalidation, exact current-state output, and absence of NUL. Verification: trap-list-in-subshell and trap-list-reinput pass; cargo test -p nsh passes 279 tests with one ignored doctest; POSIX harness unit tests and git diff --check pass."
