                        text "The recorded consequence that C locale independence is not refactorable does not hold for the embedded, multithreaded library contract. Shell locale assignments currently reach the host process environment/global locale; P0 process-environment-soundness will replace that ambient coupling with per-Shell resolution and a scoped platform boundary."
