                        kind @decision
                        text "Deferred out of P0 (priority 0 -> 2) on 2026-08-09. Right work, wrong pass — not being done now.\n\nIt only gates `cargo publish`, and publishing is not close: the public API does not exist yet (`public-api-design` and `public-api` are both open, and `docs/api-design.md` describes a surface nothing constructs). The `ssh://git@github.com/necessary-nu/nshedit.git` dependency with `git-fetch-with-cli = true` already makes clone-and-build work for anyone with access, which is every consumer there currently is.\n\nKeeping it at P0 had a cost beyond the wasted rank: it was the *only* P0 candidate `nplan_next` would return, so the computed frontier said \"publish a dependency\" while the actual work — the remaining `ck*`/`savestr` owners, `errors-are-values`, `no-ambient-state` — sat behind deps or claims and never surfaced.\n\nUn-defer when `public-api` lands and publishing is the next real step."
